---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Refund Policy — teesh-art">
  <div class="policy">
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <p>All teesh-art products are made-to-order using print-on-demand manufacturing. Because each item is custom printed specifically for you, we generally cannot accept returns or issue refunds.</p>

    <h2>Defective or damaged items</h2>
    <p>If your item arrives with a print defect or shipping damage, we will send a free replacement. To qualify:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact us within <strong>14 days</strong> of delivery</li>
      <li>Provide a photo clearly showing the defect or damage</li>
      <li>You do not need to return the defective item</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Once we verify the issue, a replacement will be produced and shipped at no additional cost.</p>

    <h2>What we cannot replace or refund</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Orders where the wrong size was selected (please check sizing before ordering)</li>
      <li>Items that have been worn, washed, or altered</li>
      <li>Requests made more than 14 days after delivery</li>
      <li>Color differences due to monitor/screen settings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to request a replacement</h2>
    <p>Email us at <strong>support@teesh-art.com</strong> with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your order number</li>
      <li>A photo of the defect</li>
      <li>Brief description of the issue</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We aim to respond within 2 business days.</p>

    <h2>Cancellations</h2>
    <p>Because production begins immediately after payment, orders cannot be cancelled once placed.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .policy h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy p {
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  .policy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
